<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17185" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exsē^crābĭlis</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">execr-</span></b> ), e, adj.
		exsecror. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Pass.</i>, <i>execrable</i>, <i>accursed</i>, <i>detestable</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exsecr. ac dirum solum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 1, 1, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nihil exsecrabilius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					9, 48, 72, § 155</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Levit. 11, 23
			al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>execrating</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praeeuntibus exsecrabile carmen sacerdotibus,</span>”
				<i>the song of cursing</i>, <i>of execration</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					31, 17, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">odium,</span>”
				i. e. <i>raging</i>, <i>fearful</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					9, 26, 4</span></i>
			.—<i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exsē^crābĭlĭter</span></b> ,
				<i>execrably</i> (only in <i>comp.</i>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tanto exsecrabilius me oderam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. Conf. 8, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
